      "writtenOn": "2022-07-13T22:39:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Posted my earlier wip attempt to fold together this patch with the following one here in case it\u0027s useful: https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2153193\n\nOther than combining the two patches into one, the main other substantive difference is dropping the cpupri.c changes \u0026 changing cpupri_find -\u003e cpupri_find_fitness calls in rt.c. This simplifies \u0026 shortens the patch but IIRC the resulting logic differs slightly from the original changes \u0026 I hadn\u0027t yet had a chance to dig into whether that difference would be problematic.",
